+- [ ] **PREVIEW-008**: When the preview worker admits a rendered preview whose key is recorded in the ghost list, the system SHALL admit it to the reuse queue rather than the first-use queue.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-009**: When admitting a preview would push its destination queue past that queue's byte cap, the system SHALL evict entries from that queue until the preview fits.
