+- [ ] **PREVIEW-013**: While the preview worker's 2Q queues are configured, the system SHALL keep the sum of the two queue byte caps within 12 GiB of cached JPEG data.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-014**: When a cached preview is served from the reuse queue, the system SHALL update that entry's recency of service.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-015**: When the preview worker evicts an entry from the reuse queue, the system SHALL evict the least recently served entry first.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-016**: When the preview worker evicts an entry from the first-use queue, the system SHALL evict the entry admitted earliest first.
